 wiring a cp2102 with ardunio 
   
    follow this pinout connection
   
ardunio                        cp2102
tx                               rx
rxi                              tx
vcc                              5v     if you ardunio 3.3v verson than connect on 3.3v pin not 5 v
gnd                              gnd
  
  download ardunio ide  
  connect ardunio and cp2102 with pc click on upload   (code will be in code folder ) when uploading start imdiatly press ardunio reset button if you late press code fail to upload 
  after uploading connect other components (wiring diagram in diagram folder ) and fit in 3d boady (3d file also avelable in 3d file )  best material is petg donot use pla its very lite easy to break 
